# Normalise everything to LF in the repository. The shipped files are plain
# ESM/YAML/JSON read by Node and the harness, and the upstream project is
# developed on Unix, so a fixed LF both keeps diffs stable and avoids the
# CRLF-in-a-shebang class of bug if scripts are ever added.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, should any be added later (screenshots for the marketplace).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
